# The parser's TokenKind::Int case won't match CmdWord
# 
# So I need to handle CmdWord in the redirect target parsing:
# When we see Int(N) -> Arrow -> CmdWord("1") (where "1" is a single digit),
# treat it as Out(N, Lit("1"), false)... which is what we're already doing!
# But display it as "N>1" not "N>\"1\""

